pageDescription = <span style="color: gray"> Great news! I fixed the warrior cat generator. Turns out it wasn't broken, just that stupid small tab at the bottom of the code screen was pulled up over it. Not sure how it happens cause i don't remember pulling it up before saving and closing the tab though...
